    "message": "feat(commit-m): reconcile with merged #45 — close the remaining Commit-M gaps on top of main\n\nRebasing Commit M onto PR #45 (d7f16ac), which independently landed much of\nthe free-access work. This commit closes the gaps that remain OPEN on main\nafter #45, with fail-first evidence captured on the #45 tree (41→12 failures\narchived in docs/evidence/commit-m/fail-first-reconciliation-raw.txt):\n\n1. §22-§24 unified AI loop: the no-evidence path in lib/ai/router.ts still\n   returned RAW unstructured provider text (answer: text). Removed in ALL\n   paths: every request now enters the bounded tool loop; a clean\n   claims-free, number-free reply is the explicit context-only state;\n   ungroundable numeric replies on the no-evidence path are discarded;\n   tool exhaustion → BLOCKED unchanged. Tests: test/ailoop.unified.test.ts.\n2. §21 score provenance truthfulness: buildScoreItem collapsed mixed/live\n   observations into 'seed-derived'. New closed vocabulary\n   (seed-derived | <asOf> | live-undated | live-mixed-observation |\n   mixed-provenance) + truthful statement text.\n   Tests: test/score.provenance.truth.test.ts.\n3. §25 fail-closed attestation: ATTESTED_PROVIDER_MODELS in the approved\n   provider registry; the router's implicit default now comes from the\n   registry (never a local constant) and non-well-formed ids fail closed;\n   complements the merged scripts/auditModelIdentity.ts runtime audit.\n   Tests: test/ailoop.attestation.test.ts.\n4. §29 aiLoopAudit gate: scripts/aiLoopAudit.mjs (8 architecture\n   invariants) wired into ci.yml + package.json; adapted to #45's\n   z.object().strict() style and CanonicalStockState threading.\n5. §19 tool-boundary pins: test/toolboundary.strict.test.ts (passes on\n   #45's strict schemas — regression pins, not fail-first).\n6. docs/ACCESS_MODEL.md canonical access model; AI_LOOP.md unified-pipeline\n   contract.\n\nFull suite on this tree: 735/735 vitest, tsc 0, eslint 0 errors (301 < 309\nbaseline), eval:chat 113 (102 local + 11 CI), encoding/stocks/parity green,\nbuild + bundle ratchet green, both audits green.",
